  // unusable row is one organization that is not excluded, and the whole cost of
  // this file is borne on the un-burn side: a contacted-universe row whose
  // company column is spelled `org_name` instead of `company` contributed
  // nothing to `exact`, while the "populated but nothing usable" test stayed
  // satisfied by the rows around it. Measured: such a row let an
  // already-contacted organization back into the cohort.
  //
  // Carryover is NOT an exclusion source (r12), so a partial loss there is a
