  }

  // The ONE place that decides whether a value is a real jurisdiction.
  //
  // `business_state` decides whether an organization is in scope, and an
  // out-of-scope verdict costs 3650 days -- so what counts as "an answer" has to
  // be a MEMBERSHIP test, not a shape test. Three successive repairs of this
  // defect each closed on a list of bad values chosen to be the ones that repair
  // handled, and each time live HPD held another:
  //
  //   `null`     1,179 CorporateOwner/Agent rows. Caught by an emptiness test.
  //   `OFFICE`   5 rows -- ALLIANCE HOUSING in the Bronx, businesscity
  //              `WEST 166 STREET`: a row whose columns are shifted by one. NOT
  //              caught by an emptiness test; caught by a shape test.
  //   `NA`       1 CorporateOwner row (a Georgetown, Malaysia address), 53 rows
  //              across all roles. NOT caught by a shape test -- `/^[A-Z]{2}$/`
  //              admits 676 strings and only 59 are jurisdictions.
  //   `NU`       1 row, businesscity NEW YORK, zip 10001: a typo of NY. It sits
  //              on an Officer row, which N09 never lets speak for an
  //              organization, so it cannot reach G0 today -- it is what the
  //              class looks like, not a live instance of it. `NA` is the live
  //              instance on the G0 path.
  //
